# Leovold, Emissary of Trest: "Each opponent can't draw more than one card each turn." Three Moxen cast it for free on
# turn 1. In Bot1's turn 3 upkeep Bot2 has drawn nothing yet, so Ancestral Recall draws it one card of three; on its own
# turn 4 it has drawn for the turn already, so the second Ancestral Recall draws it nothing.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Leovold, Emissary of Trest
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Island
Ancestral Recall
Ancestral Recall
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Leovold, Emissary of Trest.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
[T3 Bot1.Upkeep]
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Ancestral Recall.Cast(Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot2.Hand.Count = 7
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Ancestral Recall.Cast(Bot2)
[Bot2.Main2]

